  lines:
  - speakerName: Lara
    sentence: "We don\u2019t know what\u2019s wrong with him. We found him drifting
      in the corridor, completely out of it. He told us where the rest of the team
      was, so we sent a group of three to bring them back... but they haven\u2019t
      returned yet. All we're getting from their comms is dead air."
